&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Software Test Engineering Intern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to help develop test solutions for complex wireless systems and products. Working closely with both test and development teams, you’ll receive hands-on support and guidance, allowing you to explore new products and domains. You’ll be involved in designing and creating tests to thoroughly assess products under development, often operating at the intersection of electronics and software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Successful candidates can join us between May- October 2027.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
