&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;You can find a link to our candidate privacy notice&lt;strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.triplepoint.co.uk/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;HERE.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
