&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j07 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Private Medical Insurance (BUPA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Group Income Protection (Metlife)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Group Pension Plan (Legal &amp;amp; General)&lt;/li&gt;
